WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.672
Formulas do the maths for you. Every formula starts with an equals sign.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.509
SUM adds up a range of cells.

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:10.711
AVERAGE gives the typical value, the mean.

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:14.793
MIN and MAX show the smallest and largest values.

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:19.407
And COUNTIF counts the rows in one category, like Saturday.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:30.384
Before you move on, check: Use SUM and AVERAGE on a column. Find the MIN and MAX. Try COUNTIF for one category. Check that results make sense.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:33.305
In the next lesson: Charts.
